WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
Today’s four choices are as follows:

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,400
1 unlimited ice cooler

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,200
2. One first aid kit

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,120
Contains all kinds of commercially available items that should be included

5
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:11,310
3. The host and the female subordinate have the talent of being extremely poisonous.

6
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:16,180
4. An egg that tastes delicious no matter how you cook it.

7
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,420
I choose the third one

8
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:39,390
The biggest threat to me is gone

9
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:41,520
It’s time to think about how to get out

10
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,240
Lin Dong is really uncomfortable

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,920
I only have half a ham left.

12
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:48,960
I'll be hungry tomorrow

13
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:51,040
What can we do? We can’t fight again.

14
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,510
He still has a gun

15
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:54,420
There's nothing we can do

16
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,180
When I think of Lin Dong being well fed and well clothed,

17
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:58,060
There are also three beautiful female subordinates

18
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,660
We can only starve here

19
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:03,320
I'm so angry that I can't sleep, everyone

20
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,840
Actually want to live

21
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:09,540
It’s not like there’s no other way. Let’s talk about it, Zhang Xuan.
